for his endorsement

00:10:56.567 --> 00:10:58.000
to streak naked
across the Capitol

00:10:58.000 --> 00:10:59.901
and take turns getting kicked
in the balls.

00:10:59.901 --> 00:11:01.467
Clearly, that's how Rudy got in.

00:11:01.467 --> 00:11:02.434
[ As Giuliani ]
Thanks, brothers.

00:11:02.434 --> 00:11:03.567
[ Laughter ]

00:11:03.567 --> 00:11:05.534
I can't wait to be
a member of Sigma Chi.

00:11:05.534 --> 00:11:06.901
[ Laughter ]

00:11:06.901 --> 00:11:09.267
One of our two major political
parties remains captive

00:11:09.267 --> 00:11:12.367
