00:11:15.334 --> 00:11:17.434
embracing Trump's poisonous
and corrosive lies.

00:11:17.434 --> 00:11:19.467
They don't care
if they get caught lying,

00:11:19.467 --> 00:11:21.934
but they do care if they
get caught insulting Trump.

00:11:21.934 --> 00:11:24.734
That's when they act like they
just stepped in some deep...

00:11:24.734 --> 00:11:25.868
-[Bleep]

00:11:25.868 --> 00:11:28.801
[ Laughter ]

00:11:30.601 --> 00:11:31.801
